# Hexagonal Go

```text
cmd              → bootstrap only (package main)
internal/core/*/domain  → entities, invariants (no infra imports)
internal/core/*/ports   → interfaces only
internal/core/*/service → use cases via ports
internal/adapters/inbound/http  → Gin, DTOs, middleware
internal/adapters/outbound/*    → GORM, Redis, storage, events
internal/platform/*             → shared infra primitives
```

- Handlers translate HTTP → service calls; no business rules in handlers.
- Repositories map DB models ↔ domain; do not leak GORM types into core.
- Pass `context.Context` across service and adapter boundaries.
- Constructor injection in `internal/bootstrap`; avoid package-level mutable state.
